  "bodyHash": "10bc5258850026c7",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這是 <strong>Backpacked</strong> 的 <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本，同時也有提供 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Forge</strong> 版本</span></a><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;可供下載！</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/670/640/backpacked_banner.png\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#9e0b0f\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/503/251/warning_icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;<strong>重要事項：</strong></span></span> 必須先安裝 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/503/244/icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Framework (Fabric)</span></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Backpacked 不僅僅是一款普通的背包模組。除了你預期的功能外，Backpacked 透過挑戰等進度系統提供了有趣的遊戲體驗。完成挑戰有助於自訂背包；這是一個全新的系統，允許玩家透過不同的模型來自定義他們的背包。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">引入掏包機制後，玩家可以與他人分享背包中的物品。你必須站在玩家正後方且處於伸手可及的距離才能開啟他們的背包。別擔心，透過豐富的設定選項，你可以自訂或完全停用此功能。例如更改背包容量、死亡時保留背包等等！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組的所有選單與模型皆採用原版風格設計，非常適合不想破壞原版體驗的玩家。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Backpacked 內建支援&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/639/925/trinkets_icon.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;<strong>Trinkets (Fabric)&nbsp;</strong>（推薦）以提供更好的相容性。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>✅ 功能特色：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為玩家提供額外的物品欄儲存空間。<strong>按下 B 鍵即可開啟背包！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用不同模型自訂你的背包。完成挑戰以解鎖更多背包。<strong>全部收集起來吧！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掏包機制。與其他玩家分享背包中的物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">置物架可用於存放與展示已解鎖的背包。支援漏斗！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">豐富的設定選項。禁止特定物品放入背包、調整掏包機制等！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支援 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/639/925/trinkets_icon.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Trinkets (Fabric)</span></strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開發者可透過外掛新增更多背包（見 <a href=\"https://github.com/MrCrayfish/BackpackedAddon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">範例模組</span></a>）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">精美的選單與模型，完美還原原版風格！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/126/backpacks.gif\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/125/newscreenshot4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/135/newscreenshot5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">🙋&zwj;♀️ <strong>需要協助或想追蹤模組開發進度：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言區並不適合提供技術支援，因此 MrCrayfish 建議您加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/639/927/discord_icon.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;Discord 社群</span></a>。在這裡您可以獲得模組安裝與設定的協助、解決崩潰問題等！此外，您還能第一時間獲取模組更新與開發動態。<strong>點擊下方橫幅加入 🔽</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/639/926/310/172/discordbanner.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"88\"></a></span></p>",
